-sc\" class=\"link stretch-link\"></a>        <figure class=\"card__featured-image\">\n        <img width=\"640\" height=\"480\" src=\"/images/2026/09/plumbing-1-1024x768.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"plumber looking at pipes under a sink\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/images/2026/09/plumbing-1-1024x768.jpg 1024w, /images/2026/09/plumbing-1-300x225.jpg 300w, /images/2026/09/plumbing-1-768x576.jpg 768w, /images/2026/09/plumbing-1-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, /images/2026/09/plumbing-1-2048x1536.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" />    </figure>\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Signs Your Home&#8217;s Plumbing Is Approaching a Major Milestone In Its Lifespan\" aria-label=\"Signs Your Home&#8217;s Plumbing Is Approaching a Major Milestone In Its Lifespan\">Signs Your Home&#8217;s Plumbing Is Approaching a Major Milestone In Its Lifespan</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">Pipes last a long time, which is why so few homeowners know how old theirs are&hellip;</div>\n\n            <div class=\"card__content__cta\">\n<a href=\"/about-us/blog/signs-your-plumbing-is-approaching-a-milestone-columbia-sc\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"false\" class=\"cta\">\n    <span >Read More</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>    </div></div>\n<div  class=\"card card--post has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n<a href=\"/about-us/blog/air-conditioning-installation-costs-colulmbia-sc\" class=\"link stretch-link\"></a>        <figure class=\"card__featured-image\">\n        <img width=\"640\" height=\"458\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Carrier-air-conditioning-unit-installed-on-the-exterior-of-a-building-1024x733.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size